{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange noise persists. One day it just started and would not go away... A whisper in the dark. An unfamiliar presence, just beyond your sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are drawn into a world of spiraling darkness, where nothing is as it seems, and suffering is both a language and a landscape. Strange oddities surround you... Every object tells a story, not all of them want to be remembered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you search for clues buried within the shadows, the world around you unfolds. The deeper you look, the more your mind begins to fracture. What seems like a simple task soon becomes an obsession,uncovering things best left hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the items. Piece together the fragments. But beware... the darkness may already be inside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ hours of tense, story-driven horror gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels and locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person immersive gameplay drenched in atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cryptic items and uncover clues to push forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging environmental challenges that reward exploration and wit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic sound design. Every creak, whisper, and distant footstep matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A presence that watches... waits... and appears when you least expect it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658680?t=1759926778","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658680?t=1759926778","c