lect cryptic items and uncover clues to push forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging environmental challenges that reward exploration and wit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic sound design. Every creak, whisper, and distant footstep matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A presence that watches... waits... and appears when you least expect it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Brainrot Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658680/248e0d686f131f69f058b6ed15d68af81a73cc04/header.jpg?t=1759926778","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu LTS, SteamOS, Arch Linux, Fedora<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 1600x, Intel Core i5-7600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3658680/2131957752/773d681beaa8bd144186982e29ac90026daacfca/1759926555/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759926777","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3658680/2131957752/773d681beaa8bd144186982e29ac90026daacfca/1759926555/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759926777","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3658680/2131957752/773d681beaa8bd144186982e29ac90026daacfca/1759926555/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759926777","id":257214225,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214225/movie480.mp4?t=1759926777","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214225/movie_max.mp4?t=1759926777"},"name":"The Gurgling Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse